    "structural_explanation": "BOTH thresholds are unreachable: no proposal attains tau_r (max score 0.640) and none attains tau_c (max confidence 0.661). The OR rule therefore has two dead branches, so every Boolean combination collapses to the same constant classifier. The four rules are identical by construction, not by coincidence."
  },
